blocks.en:
Model depth. Deeper models naturally develop stable representations at later absolute layers;
yet the relative pruning point, expressed as a fraction of total depth, tends to
remain consistent across architectures.

blocks.zh:
型号深度. 更深的模型在后期的绝对分层自然发展出稳定的表示;
然而,以总深度的一小部分表示的相对穿透点倾向于
各个架构保持一致。
